---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---

<InfoLayout title="Privacy Policy | FreeOnlineToolkit" description="Privacy policy for FreeOnlineToolkit.org. Learn how we handle your data and protect your privacy.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: January 2026</em></p>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Introduction</h2>
  <p>At FreeOnlineToolkit.org, we take your privacy seriously. This policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our website and tools.</p>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i> Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>We collect minimal information.</strong> Our calculators and tools run entirely in your browser. Your calculations are processed on your device and are not sent to our servers.</p>
  <p>We may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Anonymous usage data</strong> via Google Analytics (page views, tool usage patterns)</li>
    <li><strong>Ad-related data</strong> via Google AdSense (see their policy for details)</li>
    <li><strong>Information you voluntarily provide</strong> via our contact form (name, email, message)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-cookie"></i> Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use minimal cookies for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google AdSense — to serve relevant ads</li>
    <li>Local storage — to remember your recently used tools (this stays on your device)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple"></i> Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our site. This helps us improve our tools and content. Google Analytics collects anonymous data such as pages visited, time spent, and browser type.</p>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-ad"></i> Advertising</h2>
  <p>We display ads via Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to serve relevant ads based on your browsing history. You can learn more about how Google uses your data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's partner site policy</a>.</p>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Data Security</h2>
  <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information. However, no online service is 100% secure. Since most of our tools run client-side, your calculation data never leaves your browser.</p>

  <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i> Third-Party Links</h2>
  <p>Our site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these sites.</p>

  <h2><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i> Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <strong>contact@freeonlinetoolkit.org</strong>.</p>
</InfoLayout>
